{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a DEMO version of Kingdomino, with access to 2 complete games. Invite a friend, or play against the AI!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lord seeking new lands in which to expand your kingdom. You must explore all the lands, including wheat fields, lakes, and mountains, to spot the best plots, while competing with other lords to acquire them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official adaptation of Kingdomino, the winner of the prestigious 2017 Spiel des Jahres award.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/60680090aed2c0c24f099efcb011ce5e.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/af15dcca63e01ed6e41324a92500c08c.poster.avif?t=1757861145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/af15dcca63e01ed6e41324a92500c08c.webm?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/af15dcca63e01ed6e41324a92500c08c.mp4?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle quick-witted AI opponents, join competitive online multiplayer matches, or team up with friends. Conquer the 7x7 Mighty Duel for hardcore strategy fans, or complete 15+ unique quest challenges to test your tactical skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/acd4f98738413bda70ae9a11d745acc5.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/609dde016a3eb9a49dcab3b971739325.poster.avif?t=1757861145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/609dde016a3eb9a49dcab3b971739325.webm?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/609dde016a3eb9a49dcab3b971739325.mp4?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solo expedition through mysterious, uncharted territories! Discover domino pieces to gain exclusive rewards, and build your empire in this immersive single-player campaign mode designed for exploration and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/9e2ee1bc5bce979d01aa53e700bb2a59.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a thriving gaming community in seasonal events and daily challenges! Collaborate with players worldwide to unlock exclusive limited-time rewards. Complete special quest objectives, earn community points, and participate in time-limited events that bring players together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/e68d99d58b1c004f93b7551468fffdab.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/3fa9d6d571d19d1cda7fa49698fa11c9.poster.avif?t=1757861145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/3fa9d6d571d19d1cda7fa49698fa11c9.webm?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/3fa9d6d571d19d1cda7fa49698fa11c9.mp4?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved game with both versions of Kingdomino, choose between the new Kingdomino artwork by Pauline D\u00e9traz, or the Classic Kingdomino artwork by Cyril Bouquet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect unique Meeples and Castle designs to make your realm truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/bc0e33adb30dff7f6d19bd418bb448d8.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless multiplayer gaming across all devices. Challenge friends and rivals, whether they're playing on PC or mobile - True cross-platform compatibility ensures you'll always find opponents ready to battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player builds a kingdom by connecting domino-like tiles showing different terrains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominoes have two squares with different or matching landscapes, some featuring crowns that multiply points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your castle tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns selecting from available terrain tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect tiles to matching landscapes (forests, fields, lakes, mountains)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategically to create large territories with multiple crowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by multiplying territory size by the number of crowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games take 10-20 minutes, making Kingdomino perfect for quick sessions or hours of strategic kingdom building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011100?t=1757861145","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4011100?t=1757861145","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/bf63645f6f84daa430be82134e755004fd969b4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757861145","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/bf63645f6f84daa430be82134e755004fd969b4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757861145","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Reviews</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/b23dbe7868af0f672129d4d4f04fe154.avif?t=1757861145\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Demo</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a DEMO version of Kingdomino, with access to 2 complete games. Invite a friend, or play against the AI!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a lord seeking new lands in which to expand your kingdom. You must explore all the lands, including wheat fields, lakes, and mountains, to spot the best plots, while competing with other lords to acquire them first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The official adaptation of Kingdomino, the winner of the prestigious 2017 Spiel des Jahres award.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/60680090aed2c0c24f099efcb011ce5e.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/af15dcca63e01ed6e41324a92500c08c.poster.avif?t=1757861145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/af15dcca63e01ed6e41324a92500c08c.webm?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/af15dcca63e01ed6e41324a92500c08c.mp4?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle quick-witted AI opponents, join competitive online multiplayer matches, or team up with friends. Conquer the 7x7 Mighty Duel for hardcore strategy fans, or complete 15+ unique quest challenges to test your tactical skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/acd4f98738413bda70ae9a11d745acc5.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/609dde016a3eb9a49dcab3b971739325.poster.avif?t=1757861145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/609dde016a3eb9a49dcab3b971739325.webm?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/609dde016a3eb9a49dcab3b971739325.mp4?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solo expedition through mysterious, uncharted territories! Discover domino pieces to gain exclusive rewards, and build your empire in this immersive single-player campaign mode designed for exploration and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/9e2ee1bc5bce979d01aa53e700bb2a59.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a thriving gaming community in seasonal events and daily challenges! Collaborate with players worldwide to unlock exclusive limited-time rewards. Complete special quest objectives, earn community points, and participate in time-limited events that bring players together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/e68d99d58b1c004f93b7551468fffdab.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/3fa9d6d571d19d1cda7fa49698fa11c9.poster.avif?t=1757861145\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/3fa9d6d571d19d1cda7fa49698fa11c9.webm?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/3fa9d6d571d19d1cda7fa49698fa11c9.mp4?t=1757861145\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the beloved game with both versions of Kingdomino, choose between the new Kingdomino artwork by Pauline D\u00e9traz, or the Classic Kingdomino artwork by Cyril Bouquet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and collect unique Meeples and Castle designs to make your realm truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/extras/bc0e33adb30dff7f6d19bd418bb448d8.avif?t=1757861145\" width=614 height=89 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless multiplayer gaming across all devices. Challenge friends and rivals, whether they're playing on PC or mobile - True cross-platform compatibility ensures you'll always find opponents ready to battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOW TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player builds a kingdom by connecting domino-like tiles showing different terrains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominoes have two squares with different or matching landscapes, some featuring crowns that multiply points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with your castle tile.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take turns selecting from available terrain tiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect tiles to matching landscapes (forests, fields, lakes, mountains)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strategically to create large territories with multiple crowns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score points by multiplying territory size by the number of crowns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games take 10-20 minutes, making Kingdomino perfect for quick sessions or hours of strategic kingdom building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Meeple Corp"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3029180","name":"Kingdomino"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4011100/25e969d807e3c16267923ddfb41cb21c0557235d/header.jpg?t=1757861145","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Blue Orange Edition. Kingdomino and Blue Orange are trademarks of Blue Orange Edition, France. Game published and distributed under license by Blue Orange, 97 impasse Jean Lamour, 54700 Pont-\u00e0-Mousson, France.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor</li></ul>"},"name":"Kingdomino Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Meeple Corp"]